      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a decent start, but it's actually a bit too short for what my boss is looking for. The automated scoring script is flagging it because the word count is quite low, and we really need something way more comprehensive to get a high rank.\n\nCould you expand on this? Try to go much deeper into the specifics of each point—maybe group them into categories like 'Display & Design', 'Performance & Battery', and 'Camera Capabilities' to help with the length. \n\nJust a reminder though: please make sure you're actually adding new details or explaining the implications of the reviews. I really don't want just a bunch of repetitive sentences to inflate the word count; I need actual depth and substance to make the summary useful. Can you beef this up significantly?",
